bds 4,4 "Meteorological routine air report"
date 2026-10-14
preamble
    Meteorological routine air report: wind, temperature, pressure,
    turbulence and humidity at the aircraft position.
    Source: ICAO Doc 9871 Table A-2-33.

items

    FOM "Figure of Merit"
        definition
            Figure of merit of the report.
        element 4
            unsigned integer
        remark
            Values above 4 indicate invalid data.

    WINDSTATUS "Wind Status"
        definition
            Validity of the wind speed and direction values.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    WINDSPEED "Wind Speed"
        definition
            Wind speed.
        element 9
            unsigned quantity 1 "kt"

    WINDDIR "Wind Direction"
        definition
            True wind direction.
        element 9
            unsigned quantity 180/256 "°"

    SATSIGN "Static Air Temperature Sign"
        definition
            Sign of the static air temperature magnitude.
        element 1
            table
                0: Positive
                1: Negative
        remark
            Combined with SAT into a single signed value.

    SAT "Static Air Temperature Magnitude"
        definition
            Magnitude of the static air temperature.
        element 10
            unsigned quantity 1/4 "°C"
        remark
            Combined with SATSIGN into a single signed value.

    PRESSSTATUS "Static Pressure Status"
        definition
            Validity of the static pressure value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    PRESS "Static Pressure"
        definition
            Average static pressure.
        element 11
            unsigned quantity 1 "hPa"

    TURBSTATUS "Turbulence Status"
        definition
            Validity of the turbulence value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    TURB "Turbulence"
        definition
            Turbulence level.
        element 2
            table
                0: Nil
                1: Light
                2: Moderate
                3: Severe

    HUMSTATUS "Humidity Status"
        definition
            Validity of the humidity value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    HUMIDITY "Humidity"
        definition
            Relative humidity.
        element 6
            unsigned quantity 100/64 "%"
